    "Synthetic values only. Send x-waldo-app-contract: health=8 (or later) to GET /app/v1/health/scores and /scores/history to receive components and usual; a build below revision 8 gets exactly the bodies it had.",
    "components is keyed by pillar and holds a pillar's parts only while that pillar is available. share is the part's share over the parts that had a reading, so shares add up to 1; points = share x score; the points add up to the pillar's score before it is rounded.",
    "direction says which way the reading stood against the owner's usual at one spread (above_usual, usual, below_usual). It is null for sleep (read against the owner's need) and for from_the_night (made of parts). It is a description of a reading, not good or bad.",
    "usual is one band per signal, low to high in the signal's unit. A natural-log signal (overnight_hrv) is back-transformed, so its band is not symmetric about its centre. sleep_midpoint is a minute of the owner's local day, 0 to 1439, and its band may cross midnight (low later in the day than high).",
    "Show a band as 'your usual' only at state personal; at provisional say the usual is still being learned and show own_days of 14. own_share is how much of the centre is the owner's own data rather than a population prior.",
    "A part with no reading is { key, state: unavailable, reason: no_reading | baseline_immature }, never a zero."
